  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEO: Georgia: Supporting More Responsive and Inclusive Political Decision-Making</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Democratic Institute proposes a three-year program to help parliamentary bodies better fulfil their legislative, oversight, and representative roles through: facilitating citizen-informed and evidence-based decision making; supporting improved coordination; assisting permanent parliamentary units provide more effective support to members in leadership and on committees, as well as relevant staff; and equipping civil society organizations focused on issues of inclusion and representing traditionally marginalized communities with the knowledge and skills to exercise greater influence on decision-making processes in parliament. This program will build on and draw lessons from National Democratic Institute&#x2019;s previous UK-funded Good Governance Fund and FCDO programs.</narrative>
  </description>
